[[ commit created by automation ]]

* Allow IConfigureOptions<StartupValidatorOptions> to be registered multiple times

.NET 11's OptionsBuilderExtensions.ValidateOnStart now registers
IConfigureOptions<StartupValidatorOptions> twice (one configure action for
synchronous validation and one for asynchronous validation). AddRazorComponents
calls AddMetrics, which invokes ValidateOnStart, so the service-count assertion
in RazorComponentsServiceCollectionExtensionsTest now sees 2 registrations
instead of 1. Treat this internal service type as a multi-registration service
so the test validates distinct implementation types instead of an exact count.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

