SUBJECT [Blazor united] Initial startup APIs for registering pages and rendering from an endpoint (#46996)
BODY * Adds the new Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints project for Server-Side Rendering components.
* Adds the structure for registering server side rendered Razor Component Endpoints.
* Adds a sample for Blazor United.
* Adds APIs for registering pages as endpoints and renders a static document for each page.


